---
import Layout from "../layouts/Layout.astro";
import CommunityLink from "../components/CommunityLink.astro";
---

<Layout title="Terms of Service">
  <section class="card space-y-4 [&>p]:ml-4">
    <h1 class="text-center">Terms of Service</h1>
    <h3>Acceptance of Terms</h3>
    <p>
      By using the service, you agree to comply with and be bound by these Terms
      of Service. If you do not agree, do not use the application.
    </p>
    <h3>Description of Service</h3>
    <p>
      The bot collects message content data from channels it has access to, and
      transcribes speech in voice channels it joins, using that data for
      training a Markov chain for text generation. It learns from new messages
      as they are sent; the /train command also lets it fetch past messages.
    </p>
    <h3>Data Collection</h3>
    <p>
      The bot collects message content and voice transcripts, not their authors.
      It saves media URLs, including images, GIFs, and videos, even NSFW ones.
      See the <a href="/privacy-policy">Privacy Policy</a> for details.
    </p>
    <h3>User Responsibilities</h3>
    <p>
      You are responsible for ensuring the bot has the correct permissions to
      access channels. You agree not to misuse the bot for illegal activities.
    </p>
    <h3>Prohibited Conduct</h3>
    <p>
      No spamming, phishing, malicious activities, harassment, hate speech, or
      any other harmful behavior. Do not use automated scripts to interact with
      the bot inappropriately.
    </p>
    <h3>Open Source and Usage</h3>
    <p>The bot's code is open source, and we encourage free and open use.</p>
    <h3>Termination</h3>
    <p>
      We reserve the right to suspend or terminate your access at any time,
      without notice, if your conduct violates these Terms of Service or harms
      others.
    </p>
    <h3>Limitation of Liability</h3>
    <p>
      The bot is provided "as is" without warranties of any kind. We are not
      liable for any damages, including loss of profits, goodwill, use, or data.
    </p>
    <h3>Amendments</h3>
    <p>
      We reserve the right to modify these Terms of Service at any time. Changes
      will be effective immediately upon posting. Continued use of the
      application constitutes acceptance of the modified terms.
    </p>
    <h3>Contact Information</h3>
    <p>
      For questions about these Terms of Service, contact us on the{" "}
      <CommunityLink />.
    </p>
  </section>
</Layout>
